	('9aefe589-3d1b-480e-8b66-fdf2df7efdf5', '69813433-5d9d-429a-a3a4-26faa76dbb70', 'Explore Construct 3 Quiz Game', 'Pembelajaran pembuatan quiz game di Construct 3 dengan tema Funny Math Quest. Siswa akan mempelajari cara membuat quiz interaktif.', 3, 1, 'Pelajari pembuatan quiz game di Construct 3. Buat math quiz game dengan minimal 10 soal humor element dan scoring system. Submit hasil game.', '2026-01-28 04:54:47.227707+00', '2026-02-05 08:21:06.403223+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vR_TL_olCk2AeTieWybyCTJ-dpbRp-EuEDbMwhLVOH1o9Uk1WAtXANUFhGmcW97lQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('f2aaf267-6c5c-414b-8fd8-f8c3162316f8', '3b6c06a4-da43-40d6-af9b-e6243ddd4511', 'Evaluasi dan Refleksi', 'Evaluasi dan refleksi komprehensif terhadap pengalaman belajar di Blok 4 melalui self evaluation analysing storytelling educational game design promotional communication dan civic entrepreneurship.', 13, 1, 'Create comprehensive self evaluation 1) Creative expression evolution Book Creator comics 2) Educational game design philosophy compare 3 Kodu projects 3) Cultural preservation reflection 4) Promotional thinking 5) Civic entrepreneurship 6) Bebras persistence 7) Holistic portfolio curation 8) Final Blok preparation. Submit thorough evaluation visual portfolio growth evidence goals statement.', '2026-01-28 04:05:19.746372+00', '2026-01-28 04:27:13.154629+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('4d674db0-ba46-43e1-ab0e-7e160eae5460', '8b16970a-a20f-4b4a-82fd-764b69b8134b', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 2', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar kedua dengan tema Volcanoes Threats and Benefits. Siswa akan membuat produk edukasi tentang gunung berapi.', 10, 4, 'Kerjakan Big Project 2 Volcanoes 1) Riset tentang gunung berapi di Indonesia ancaman dan manfaatnya 2) Buat game atau aplikasi edukasi 3) Testing dengan user 4) Buat poster promosi. Submit produk final research report testing documentation.', '2026-01-28 04:43:06.087596+00', '2026-01-28 04:43:06.087596+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
