	('59782453-32af-4db2-bf71-b9302016cbe1', '9ff3f963-46a6-45fe-afed-87039c85c36b', '271eacb2-e8f1-426d-b7f0-939a386742dc', 'Project 16 Kodu Game Lab Our Body (Part 1)', 'Proyek educational game 3D menggunakan Kodu Game Lab dengan tema Our Body bagaimana menjaga kesehatan tubuh organ dan fungsi. Siswa akan riset tentang sistem tubuh manusia dan mengembangkan ide game berdasarkan anggota tubuh pilihan.', 4001, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan educational Kodu game project 1) Choose 1 body system untuk focus research in depth 2) Design game mechanics yang teaches about chosen system 3) Build game in Kodu dengan 3D environment obstacles collectibles educational content 4) Add visual labels create health bar. Submit game link research documentation educational content outline playtesting report.', '2026-01-30 04:47:55.079608+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:30.682413+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vScDuQKAHlCnnVHFC7PTASzhtAobNfLZ69efBMJ9hH488CHoQas3nJwhYVlTIMjAQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
