	('476892f9-9468-434b-a1c6-b7b1655d8eb2', '700894de-a114-48b6-b02f-c72bd77f8c59', '6383a20f-e90c-4e2f-9931-ce23c6150d39', 'Visual System and Transition to Wireframe', 'Pembelajaran sistem visual dan wireframing. Siswa mengintegrasikan prinsip desain warna dan layout menjadi visual system.', 4, 'fccc7231-0f13-4fdf-b6a9-f0faf2baee40', '2025-12-13 03:30:00+00', 'Pelajari Visual System dan Wireframing. Buat style guide dan low-fi wireframe. Submit design system doc.', '2026-03-13 06:51:32.624306+00', '2026-03-26 12:13:48.344541+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('db76ef5d-4ef1-4ab3-8e48-f733484a8d27', '8368012f-75c7-4451-9bf0-fc4eefec5307', '5df18592-57a1-4b73-92dc-84e17ca2fe76', 'Challenge Mini Story (Part 2)', 'Proyek pembuatan cerita pendek interaktif. Siswa akan membuat animasi cerita dengan tema Kehidupan Sehari-hari.', 7000, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan Challenge Mini Story. Buat animasi cerita pendek minimal 2 scene dengan dialog. Submit animasi.', '2026-02-27 04:19:43.136612+00', '2026-03-26 13:53:31.318149+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vR2JxyJt0u593x_-hjZuq54oPyufWjWhlqQ3W_1f_gi14CQALeZvJTMzRjnvFHbpg/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('64e68390-5d46-403d-af6d-ecbd60cddcd0', '700894de-a114-48b6-b02f-c72bd77f8c59', '0dd8a00f-2fce-4d09-a456-7c504a40a403', 'Design Interactive UI (Part 1)', 'Pembelajaran pembuatan UI interaktif. Siswa membuat prototype aplikasi Data Management.', 6, 'd3730a34-f503-4ef5-98e5-9652663f4b5d', '2025-12-27 03:30:00+00', 'Pelajari prototyping di Figma. Buat interactive mockup untuk aplikasi Data Management. Submit clickable prototype.', '2026-03-13 06:51:32.624306+00', '2026-03-26 12:13:48.424381+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('436c5e5a-de0a-41bb-bf8f-1722216eaf89', 'd7e7e3b6-71c3-4f78-9a08-79c4dfb8d236', 'a1bcb78f-27e2-4670-88ab-c441f4876297', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 1 (Part 4)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar pertama dengan tema Treasure Hunt Nusantara. Siswa akan membuat game treasure hunt yang menampilkan kekayaan budaya Nusantara.', 20, '83cb2af3-a3a7-48cb-ae8f-6bbea7413340', '2025-04-11 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 1 Treasure Hunt Nusantara 1) Riset tentang budaya dan landmark Nusantara 2) Buat game design document 3) Develop game treasure hunt yang menampilkan minimal 5 lokasi ikonik Indonesia 4) Testing dan polish. Submit game link design document dan dokumentasi proses.', '2026-02-27 10:11:59.583381+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:01.409423+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vSTpvmEtnY2MyyAscF64IrjEYTyRa6S-NnprDBiDYui-U9Ucrxf5E0iigoNUmfEwQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('815c7582-b3cb-4ed1-bb8a-aa74cfea22e8', 'd7e7e3b6-71c3-4f78-9a08-79c4dfb8d236', '4ace3c98-0e39-4458-b6eb-3e0781414843', 'Pembuatan Poster Project', '', 21, 'fb7d81ed-a09f-4239-9ec5-53be598c588f', '2025-04-25 09:15:00+00', NULL, '2026-02-27 10:11:59.583381+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:01.487094+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('5be507fa-d6f7-4f7b-8864-4c44fda53a52', 'a62ca0b4-f3a9-4e49-ad01-899bc32eb54c', '64c2cbbf-f2e9-4e7f-98fd-5f658c127b33', 'User Auth Login Register', 'Menambahkan sistem user login. Buat halaman login dan simpan user di Firebase Auth.', 12001, '21032307-8301-40ac-b061-f73369bca75b', '2026-03-28 06:00:00+00', NULL, '2026-03-04 03:08:38.330423+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:21.689741+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('c182047f-9d91-4b57-9342-768f87a64a4a', '79e5da7a-d9a0-4896-b6c3-219dc875a801', 'b0e866a9-3263-4ff8-bcc8-87bb9231d81c', 'Explore Code.Org Debugging dan Looping (Part 1)', 'Pembelajaran mendalam tentang debugging process dan advanced looping functions dalam pemrograman menggunakan Code.org. Siswa akan memahami systematic debugging approach dan optimization melalui proper use of loops.', 1001, NULL, NULL, 'Pelajari advanced debugging dan looping concepts di Code.org 1) Complete debugging-focused modules minimal 12 puzzles 2) Master complex looping patterns nested loops loops with conditionals 3) Create challenging puzzle solution demonstrating mastery 4) Document debugging mindset. Submit course completion certificates debugging case studies loop optimization examples.', '2026-01-30 04:47:55.244783+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:31.437687+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('6d99fe5a-b353-4a4a-b50c-7e8c85294c2e', 'f64299b0-2ab6-4a61-b14a-14f7b05fb79c', '67da2bd3-10e6-4814-8688-215579c102e8', 'Challenge (Part 2)', 'Proyek tantangan pembuatan game dengan MakeCode.', 92000, '116aeec3-96ca-496b-b70e-edd362132546', '2026-06-04 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan Challenge MakeCode. Buat game dengan objectives dan win/lose conditions. Submit game.', '2026-02-27 04:19:43.680727+00', '2026-03-26 13:53:34.707846+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('fc2cfe5f-b8d2-47f9-bd92-234d45511e8b', 'a4591561-5a16-46bd-a40f-f1df251c1a37', '4d811d24-42c8-4d26-8cf6-5c3427285fab', 'Study Tour Game Company Virtual Visit dan Reverse Engineering (Part 2)', 'Pembelajaran tentang real-world professional game development process melalui virtual visit ke game companies dan praktik reverse engineering analyzing popular games untuk memahami development considerations.', 5002, NULL, NULL, 'Complete virtual study tour dan reverse engineering 1) Watch minimal 3 game studio content types large studio indie developer documentary 2) Play selected game extensively 3) Deconstruct core loop progression UI art audio implementation 4) Industry insights synthesis. Submit observation report reverse engineering analysis career exploration reflection.', '2026-01-29 09:12:26.05999+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:04.022037+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('1b3cbdd7-b117-43e0-9855-185a0145318e', '7cc50b7e-f122-4dca-857b-3bf2a9e857ae', '6322a867-7f6d-41e3-8312-51983ed131c3', 'Explore Canva', 'Pembelajaran desain grafis menggunakan Canva dengan tema refleksi ''Apa yang suka aku pelajari di Clevio?''. Siswa akan memahami cara membuat poster digital yang menarik dan informatif menggunakan berbagai fitur Canva.', 12, '1932a34e-3f90-4acb-8509-191a27cc4b13', '2026-01-05 09:00:00+00', 'Pelajari tools dan fitur-fitur dasar Canva untuk membuat poster. Buatlah latihan poster sederhana tentang hal-hal yang dipelajari di Clevio, gunakan minimal 3 elemen desain (gambar, teks, shape).', '2026-03-26 07:15:31.260213+00', '2026-03-26 14:25:44.257395+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTxTaL-YV4lsWk4P84EJ1AwG1IHd9M7cjeUVr86iT6jeAgIgBY81C5OjXOh37xr3A/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
