	('c89f709e-9c7f-47a4-a94d-d6f1e35ff630', '296b63d4-3c28-43be-95ca-988b9e680e21', 'a1ecd40a-9dd0-477e-b458-cc97de1c9620', 'Explore AppLab', 'Pembelajaran lanjutan pembuatan aplikasi menggunakan AppLab Code.org untuk memperdalam kemampuan app development.', 1, 'ba3bf01f-1c73-4853-82ac-f03f1b04bcc8', '2025-11-14 09:15:00+00', 'Pelajari fitur lanjutan AppLab Code.org. Buat aplikasi dengan fitur yang lebih complex. Submit hasil aplikasi.', '2026-02-27 10:11:59.917392+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:02.659017+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('0cdb7d7f-5cad-42e4-90c7-5ddc81c8d327', '296b63d4-3c28-43be-95ca-988b9e680e21', '8db54b19-80b1-446f-8d09-429ec0b4d6a9', 'Project App Challenge (Part 1)', 'Proyek pembuatan aplikasi lanjutan dengan AppLab. Siswa akan membuat aplikasi yang lebih sophisticated.', 2, 'f1dc1081-9561-4f0e-a210-34e1b418ea74', '2025-11-21 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan proyek aplikasi dengan AppLab. Buat aplikasi lengkap dengan tema bebas fitur advanced dan user testing. Submit hasil aplikasi dan testing report.', '2026-02-27 10:11:59.917392+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:02.697066+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('6f9727e0-cc6a-43b9-80b3-b8bf78e29e64', '450f9a69-c723-41a5-9225-c1184f12e50f', '39ae2adc-94e4-4790-8f02-d4ed3d93021e', 'Final Project Game Making (Part 1)', 'Fase intensive game development untuk membuat game lengkap dan polished. Siswa akan build complete game showcasing all Creator Level skills.', 8001, NULL, NULL, 'Execute comprehensive game development 1) Core development 2) Feature implementation 3) Content dan levels 4) Polish dan finalization. Submit playable game development diary playtesting report dan trailer.', '2026-01-29 09:07:08.904914+00', '2026-03-26 12:13:59.98288+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('afd57b1e-673b-487e-83b1-e6898c6cd41b', 'a4591561-5a16-46bd-a40f-f1df251c1a37', '5b555dc6-c2fd-41d5-a7bc-dfb30f75034f', 'Final Project Game Making (Part 2)', 'Fase intensive game development core production phase dimana siswa implement game product dengan full features polish dan quality. 4 meetings dedicated untuk create best possible game showcasing all Explorer Level learning.', 8002, NULL, NULL, 'Execute comprehensive game development 1) Concept finalization select concept create Game Design Document 2) Core development build foundational structure first level 3) Content features expand all levels implement all features polish UI 4) Polish optimization bug hunt add feedback elements create trailer. Submit Meeting 1-2 GDD playable prototype. Meeting 3-4 complete game playtesting log trailer post-mortem document.', '2026-01-29 09:12:26.05999+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:04.181794+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
