Note: Baca Readme dan file MD pada setiap pertemuan', 11, NULL, NULL, 'Implementasi Full CRUD operation di Firebase. Buat aplikasi data management lengkap. Submit Firebase CRUD App.', '2026-03-13 06:51:32.798815+00', '2026-03-26 12:13:49.603925+00', NULL, 'https://github.com/bagasta/firebase-clevio-foundation/tree/main/lessons', NULL),
	('3a5a4bbb-1c2e-42cc-b786-5363bd547775', '5e88081d-934a-43a2-9d26-661e218fa637', 'd523fba6-8520-4ed5-bf10-aee7bb78dbef', 'Explore Scratch 3 Animation', 'Pembelajaran pengenalan animasi di Scratch 3 dengan tema Game Trailer Animation. Siswa akan mempelajari tools animasi dasar dan cara membuat trailer game yang menarik.', 1001, '95602177-1d6f-43d6-af5b-557726b41982', '2026-01-27 10:00:00+00', 'Pelajari dasar-dasar animasi di Scratch 3 untuk membuat game trailer. Buat latihan animasi sederhana dengan karakter bergerak efek suara dan transisi scene. Submit hasil animasi.', '2026-01-29 09:07:08.196347+00', '2026-03-26 12:13:56.191614+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTYiDoW49PoKmgGWZ1u7-QThXKjBMvDFmz4WBtbkPxqIUC5HQGAbFyMR2svy2euGg/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('4e995fc7-6f5e-4411-b670-c10c93598a3f', 'de0fa9f9-3270-46b7-bfc4-51544bd546f4', '62c0ace8-63d7-4e20-a4ff-7f6e17c1241e', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 4 Tata Kota (Part 4)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar keempat dengan tema Tata Kota Urban Planning memberikan pilihan untuk develop produk game atau poster campaign dengan pendekatan entrepreneurial lengkap addressing real urban challenges.', 8004, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan Big Project 4 Urban Planning 1) Research urban issues survey minimal 10 respondents 2) Focus on 1-2 critical issues define problem statement 3) Brainstorm minimum 4 solution approaches decide product format game atau campaign 4) Develop product 5) Test dan measure impact. Submit urban research report problem statement ideation process final product impact measurement report.', '2026-01-29 09:37:24.723116+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:12.957708+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vSEvK2NeCkiVlHu8I4oXIC_naRJHpvlObOANlSNWekhY1kdK1dkls2H7yVo29pp2g/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('36630f68-1fe4-4d7d-afb7-9ccc6e778f5d', '9682e61f-a7f0-48a5-95c8-616c8c5b508d', 'd36b7263-6a38-479d-a8ed-2f424446fe2d', 'Pitching Day', 'Presentasi Big Project 1', 13001, NULL, NULL, 'Siapkan presentasi untuk dipresentasikan di pertemuan berikutnya', '2026-01-29 09:07:08.380383+00', '2026-03-26 12:13:57.872616+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRX42hOv5FMiyiCcqgyEmBHw-98d9xpTxtYNVl6OVgDwdC7lXNpXOYKnCkmTha5VA/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('0baba7b8-f6b9-4628-a1f4-b7c486f63b3d', '450f9a69-c723-41a5-9225-c1184f12e50f', '39ae2adc-94e4-4790-8f02-d4ed3d93021e', 'Final Project Game Making (Part 3)', 'Fase intensive game development untuk membuat game lengkap dan polished. Siswa akan build complete game showcasing all Creator Level skills.', 8003, NULL, NULL, 'Execute comprehensive game development 1) Core development 2) Feature implementation 3) Content dan levels 4) Polish dan finalization. Submit playable game development diary playtesting report dan trailer.', '2026-01-29 09:07:08.904914+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:00.063192+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
