2. Pertemuan 2: Desain infografis di Canva, susun informasi agar menarik dan mudah dibaca.', '2026-03-26 07:15:31.655497+00', '2026-03-26 14:25:45.849902+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTWo4z4dbsuZ3MgoE1uj2ec-MdKpLL9_Vihac50eQJG2oOX8Uy8Wx4yzEvkEXKPEg/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
