	('fded9f64-2021-4d99-a93e-25f4b5ec54f8', 'b14d5f2c-83ed-4ef4-af0a-9217dc869269', '77bb019d-ae4d-455b-be87-f3affd472636', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 1 (Part 5)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar pertama dengan tema bebas (Free). Siswa akan membuat produk animasi atau digital art.', 4000, '4aa939ec-6b94-4f81-862c-4612d91d5b09', '2025-11-06 09:15:00+00', NULL, '2026-03-06 07:22:59.638315+00', '2026-03-26 13:53:33.597026+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('97921c71-2637-433d-8a30-214bd566a45c', 'b14d5f2c-83ed-4ef4-af0a-9217dc869269', '77bb019d-ae4d-455b-be87-f3affd472636', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 1 (Part 4)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar pertama dengan tema bebas (Free). Siswa akan membuat produk animasi atau digital art.', 23000, '247d9036-9fad-40a6-b42c-cc3f55e3b06d', '2026-03-26 09:15:00+00', NULL, '2026-03-06 07:22:59.638315+00', '2026-03-26 13:53:34.312652+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('324789b6-278b-416f-a8e2-48d6be273241', '1376d19c-acce-4662-a0a4-8b7e9603a950', '39ae2adc-94e4-4790-8f02-d4ed3d93021e', 'Final Project Game Making (Part 4)', 'Fase intensive game development untuk membuat game lengkap dan polished. Siswa akan build complete game showcasing all Creator Level skills.', 8004, NULL, NULL, 'Execute comprehensive game development 1) Core development 2) Feature implementation 3) Content dan levels 4) Polish dan finalization. Submit playable game development diary playtesting report dan trailer.', '2026-02-11 05:08:36.216286+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:45.303801+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('aad276a6-7146-4039-8313-3b9659125730', '0723071c-d03c-4d28-8cd0-a108f2df5734', '1e2b5692-9a9c-4121-9fda-656cc750cc28', 'Project Game Challenge (Part 3)', 'Alun-alun kota', 12, NULL, NULL, 'Selesaikan challenge ''Project Game Challenge'' dan submit hasilnya', '2026-02-27 10:12:00.068175+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:03.888197+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRODVxN5lOtrW2gDWzlwYuGzuz1-763hNMP3jkqpr_n5Cs5u3Y1ST3pwD3LJ80SVA/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('4dda7b97-7dbd-489e-afb5-54b702027ed9', '4a0cb008-02fa-4d44-8e36-d5109dd8cc0d', '48d1fc1a-9e54-446c-a039-f50916364a66', 'Enterpreneurship Final Project Intro My Own Little Game Company', 'Sesi pengenalan dan kickoff untuk Final Project kulminasi Explorer Level dimana siswa akan create My Own Little Game Company dan develop product dari concept hingga release.', 10, NULL, NULL, 'Launch Final Project 1) Company conceptualization name logo mission values target market 2) Team formation 3-4 orang assign roles create team charter 3) Product ideation generate minimal 10-15 game concepts 4) Review Explorer journey portfolio. Submit company profile team charter initial ideation dump portfolio review.', '2026-03-26 07:15:32.157023+00', '2026-03-26 14:25:47.39444+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('77051074-b3f5-4653-b724-959852d28f49', 'fe2cfe72-4ec5-4d99-8484-bc836ea9f7ab', '4d674db0-ba46-43e1-ab0e-7e160eae5460', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 2 (Part 2)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar kedua dengan tema Volcanoes Threats and Benefits. Siswa akan membuat produk edukasi tentang gunung berapi.', 10002, 'acd3c912-0112-4298-8c70-4d7b4c278398', '2025-02-22 03:30:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 2 Volcanoes 1) Riset tentang gunung berapi di Indonesia ancaman dan manfaatnya 2) Buat game atau aplikasi edukasi 3) Testing dengan user 4) Buat poster promosi. Submit produk final research report testing documentation.', '2026-01-29 09:42:11.089167+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:16.519598+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('6c86eee6-f6b6-4bdf-960f-2335641559d7', '140a8040-9c40-47a6-b777-e30d88bbc2e4', '5d61b25e-55ed-48bf-8cdc-fd683debc92c', 'Explore Scratch 3 : Open World (Part 3)', 'Virtual Zoo', 5003, NULL, NULL, 'Pelajari dan eksplorasi materi ''Explore Scratch 3 : Open World'', buat latihan sederhana untuk dipraktekkan', '2026-02-11 05:08:36.062105+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:44.280165+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRRElW2QXzw72lgGxHCQprbSrYzedcw7ljtYONCHdQs7rx6vKibb5seKmpFQ4EBuA/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('1038cfd1-a7d0-4ffb-b10b-467bb2766c59', 'fe2cfe72-4ec5-4d99-8484-bc836ea9f7ab', 'f99a6efd-4439-49df-ab74-c0314a03cc1d', 'Explore Scratch 3 Pen dan Loudness (Part 1)', 'Pembelajaran fitur Pen dan Loudness di Scratch 3 dengan tema Music Game. Siswa akan memahami cara menggunakan input suara dan fitur pen untuk membuat game musik.', 8001, 'd428a563-899e-4566-9277-2361a2cdeee0', '2025-01-18 03:30:00+00', 'Pelajari fitur Pen untuk menggambar dan Loudness untuk input suara di Scratch 3. Buat music game demo yang merespons suara user dan menampilkan visual effects. Submit hasil game.', '2026-01-29 09:42:11.089167+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:16.326553+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vR1UIzvpWNGrkln8djyREPvWAGfQrDcus9bmv-qY3iVmDxyNmamKm4RzKoO5pNhoA/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('1a93c4ab-2a6a-4930-9e9e-ca01cde922cc', 'fe2cfe72-4ec5-4d99-8484-bc836ea9f7ab', '11d54515-cc11-47c6-bc0d-49444e7ba8ec', 'Evaluasi dan Refleksi', 'Evaluasi dan refleksi comprehensive terhadap pembelajaran di Blok 1 melalui self-evaluation. Siswa akan analyze growth dalam app development Kodular game development Roblox dan entrepreneurial thinking.', 14001, '6e99675f-dac0-4c65-8923-2ee2d310b599', '2025-04-19 03:30:00+00', 'Create comprehensive Blok 1 self-evaluation 1) Technical skills assessment Kodular Roblox platform comparison 2) Project portfolio review identify best work 3) Entrepreneurial development Big Project 1 reflection 4) Bebras CT progress 5) Collaboration soft skills 6) Goals setting. Submit thorough evaluation portfolio highlights honest assessment goals untuk Blok 2.', '2026-01-29 09:42:11.089167+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:16.813876+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQPZ-PrQxYED5FpFw12ZzIYRA5HlCIktRjf62QsQpe_0KwvDcOU-1it3fo1sOql3g/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('4134ad7b-b00d-407a-9fd3-d10acdff3cd0', 'fbb2ca76-c33a-4b79-82a1-e9e0e04f26b2', '88a5ccc0-ae64-4604-b9ac-8583fd40e617', 'Explore Python Turtle (Part 1)', 'Pembelajaran pengenalan Python menggunakan Turtle graphics. Siswa akan membuat pola geometri dengan code.', 3001, '6182a963-180e-4062-8177-019992d3b6e6', '2025-03-22 06:00:00+00', 'Pelajari Python Turtle. Buat bentuk geometri dan pola berulang dengan loops. Submit Python code.', '2026-01-29 09:43:54.598555+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:19.582086+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('021400f1-0f04-4658-95cb-fee34077a45c', '8f307fa4-74e7-4ced-b3c8-30d0bdf925d3', 'fbd40005-e240-4355-b082-6476f555226c', 'Explore Thunkable X and Firebase Auth (Part 1)', 'Pembelajaran Thunkable X dan Firebase Authentication. Siswa membuat halaman login dan register.', 42000, 'f66dd695-8ec7-4a37-bde8-45ee3694754b', '2025-06-12 09:15:00+00', 'Pelajari Thunkable X dan Firebase Auth. Buat fitur login dan register yang berfungsi. Submit app demo.', '2026-02-27 04:19:43.353807+00', '2026-03-26 13:53:32.717898+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('b14793c4-bc9d-4af1-a1ed-9e49230c2f2f', '1a590c4f-a074-4f43-ae7e-ea35ac09074a', 'e8d5dcce-0d08-45e9-bbfb-a85974191f6b', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 2 (Part 3)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar kedua dengan tema bebas.', 10003, 'a8be5868-b7ea-438d-96c2-a9b6a240334b', '2025-11-01 06:00:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 2. Buat produk aplikasi mobile yang solve user problem. Submit app dan documentation.', '2026-01-29 09:43:54.737222+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:20.876486+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('d79164f0-cbd6-4b64-b7e1-21d4f253d471', '8f307fa4-74e7-4ced-b3c8-30d0bdf925d3', 'e8d5dcce-0d08-45e9-bbfb-a85974191f6b', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 2 (Part 1)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar kedua dengan tema bebas.', 51000, '853adacb-2322-4074-ab31-f5ece33dd880', '2025-08-14 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 2. Buat produk aplikasi mobile yang solve user problem. Submit app dan documentation.', '2026-02-27 04:19:43.353807+00', '2026-03-26 13:53:33.075966+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('f76a911c-f708-430b-bb27-b1791a280afc', '0bc6635f-d430-420c-b8b6-51ead36e3273', 'ebc39d64-8162-45bf-9d55-b74e68e3347f', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 1 (Part 4)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar pertama dengan tema bebas (Free). Siswa akan membuat produk animasi atau digital art.', 6004, 'a53f4764-d48c-42f2-9dd3-7539889546c2', '2025-07-21 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 1. Buat produk digital kreatif (animasi/art) dengan business connection. Submit produk dan documentation.', '2026-01-29 10:05:38.563711+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:24.336573+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('a616bd32-cb3c-4d79-bc10-7e838d9d81a4', 'df2b2191-fb2e-4411-a510-69dc42278774', '6730b0a3-19af-4eff-943e-b3549e379f60', 'Project 13 Infografis Canva Traveling Pick Destination (Part 1)', 'Proyek kelompok untuk membuat infografis tentang destinasi wisata pilihan. Siswa bekerja sama dalam mencari informasi menarik dari berbagai media tentang sebuah destinasi wisata dan menyajikannya dalam infografis.', 8001, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan collaborative travel infographic project 2-3 orang 1) Team choose destination 2) Divide research responsibilities attractions food culture practical info 3) Compile information 4) Design infographic together in Canva 5) Review dan refine. Submit destination research report final travel infographic team process documentation.', '2026-01-30 04:47:54.914227+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:30.078346+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTWo4z4dbsuZ3MgoE1uj2ec-MdKpLL9_Vihac50eQJG2oOX8Uy8Wx4yzEvkEXKPEg/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('c3b8a1a0-7094-437b-b680-cc4dc560056b', '9f0b399f-bc3d-47d1-8d32-4ebb76d6e75d', 'edf89d20-b782-4922-860e-098ab6029272', 'Project 8 Poster Promosi Produk (Part 2)', 'Proyek pembuatan poster promosi dengan tema Play My Game. Siswa akan membuat poster untuk mempromosikan game yang telah dibuat.', 7002, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan proyek poster promosi untuk game yang pernah dibuat. Buat poster dengan judul menarik screenshot game fitur utama dan QR code untuk akses game. Submit hasil poster.', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.122175+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:38.291988+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vS8pkxHO4QEYfOawjreb6oYJLl_1YIPRPe5-sQBa9byYUWXFt8C82FFhzVcMxiXLQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('406667d4-1a9c-491c-9a7b-2eb9b15675da', '4c605558-707b-44cd-a1f9-7312383aafe1', '380ea3cf-36c1-44c9-91d9-72d54690e103', 'Project Game Challenge Funny Quiz Quest (Part 2)', 'Proyek pembuatan quiz game dengan tema Funny Quiz Quest. Siswa akan membuat quiz game pengetahuan dengan tema pilihan.', 6, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan proyek Funny Quiz Quest. Buat quiz game dengan minimal 20 soal tema pilihan varied question types dan engaging UI. Submit hasil game dan question bank.', '2026-02-27 10:12:00.228544+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:04.449391+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTUGo4iZB5suuyT42cbg3362n3sxzp8W-uakwukgMVKPkwn8RB267QPkJrikUER8w/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('a3583d62-a349-4534-8413-2ae801cfbbd3', '4a0cb008-02fa-4d44-8e36-d5109dd8cc0d', '5b555dc6-c2fd-41d5-a7bc-dfb30f75034f', 'Final Project Game Making (Part 3)', 'Fase intensive game development core production phase dimana siswa implement game product dengan full features polish dan quality. 4 meetings dedicated untuk create best possible game showcasing all Explorer Level learning.', 14, NULL, NULL, 'Execute comprehensive game development 1) Concept finalization select concept create Game Design Document 2) Core development build foundational structure first level 3) Content features expand all levels implement all features polish UI 4) Polish optimization bug hunt add feedback elements create trailer. Submit Meeting 1-2 GDD playable prototype. Meeting 3-4 complete game playtesting log trailer post-mortem document.', '2026-03-26 07:15:32.157023+00', '2026-03-26 14:25:47.542617+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('41572f5c-bf12-4bee-9d9b-211e5f99acfd', '3504d574-8dc5-4181-b7b4-d519540a5842', '4be72142-4d88-4fa5-afd9-f34d5aece8c1', 'Thunkable X and Airtable (Part 3)', 'Pembelajaran integrasi Thunkable dengan Airtable. Siswa membuat aplikasi Data Management yang terhubung database.', 8003, 'cf3852a7-7f1a-49cd-a6e9-a64b8a4b4ee3', '2025-11-10 09:15:00+00', 'Pelajari integrasi Airtable. Buat aplikasi CRUD sederhana dengan Airtable backend. Submit app demo.', '2026-01-29 10:05:38.764553+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:24.937002+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('d44b1aea-9ae7-4725-82d4-a2c6393982ae', 'fe2cfe72-4ec5-4d99-8484-bc836ea9f7ab', 'b8103209-8aef-4ba6-a096-6a4d2389c78c', 'Latihan Presentasi', '', 12001, 'c922f5d5-8602-40f6-a0bf-fb9997977aff', '2025-03-22 03:30:00+00', NULL, '2026-01-29 09:42:11.089167+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:16.663171+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('1e1a3d62-c8a6-4efe-b5d0-ecf8c6588e3a', '8a45e982-b04f-4863-8be6-83a37dbc1c0d', '6063d915-d703-48de-bbeb-40afba875915', 'Firebase Setup', 'Menghubungkan JS dengan database online Firebase. Setup Firebase project dan tes koneksi.', 9001, '39f7c992-5fb2-49cd-99a7-343318862bc9', '2026-05-04 09:15:00+00', 'Setup Firebase Console. Koneksikan aplikasi web dengan Firebase. Submit Connected Page.', '2026-01-29 10:05:38.938277+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:25.733606+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('9c0c0ea1-9214-4c91-9f30-dbd932537941', 'b14d5f2c-83ed-4ef4-af0a-9217dc869269', '66d2c855-3a92-4e09-8f0f-8d0d562bf76d', 'Condition and Loop', 'Menggunakan logika condition dan perulangan loop. Buat mini game atau quiz untuk memahami kontrol alur.', 5000, '51f7f802-fd06-4a77-a4de-313bb148dd3a', '2025-11-13 09:15:00+00', 'Implementasi logic if-else dan loops. Buat aplikasi Quiz sederhana. Submit Quiz App.', '2026-02-27 04:19:43.514293+00', '2026-03-26 13:53:33.635522+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('5bf9446b-5060-44bb-aa86-62457f364e80', 'fe2cfe72-4ec5-4d99-8484-bc836ea9f7ab', 'd36b7263-6a38-479d-a8ed-2f424446fe2d', 'Pitching Day (Part 1)', 'Presentasi Big Project 1', 13001, '118c5165-e530-4e9b-a3e6-d721493aa00e', '2025-03-29 03:30:00+00', 'Siapkan presentasi untuk dipresentasikan di pertemuan berikutnya', '2026-01-29 09:42:11.089167+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:16.706108+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRX42hOv5FMiyiCcqgyEmBHw-98d9xpTxtYNVl6OVgDwdC7lXNpXOYKnCkmTha5VA/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
