	('8b5e9733-01f5-470b-9395-b1d27de0501d', 'de0fa9f9-3270-46b7-bfc4-51544bd546f4', '73816d59-095a-4ff8-abde-edbe2c844547', 'Project 17 Kodu Game Lab Farming (Part 2)', 'Proyek game simulasi 3D dengan tema Farming natural resources. Siswa akan memahami dan mengimplementasikan proses pertanian dari tanam hingga panen dalam game simulation yang mengajarkan resource management.', 5002, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan farming simulation game di Kodu 1) Choose farming type crop farming animal husbandry fishing research realistic elements 2) Plan simulation mechanics planting care growth harvesting economics 3) Build Kodu game dengan farm environment resource tracking growth cycle economic system 4) Balance realism dan fun. Submit game link simulation design document gameplay video reflection.', '2026-01-29 09:37:24.723116+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:12.658506+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
