	('6771c8a5-183b-4386-a595-0056bdd59cea', '4dc0197a-c2bf-4345-8716-263c5bbb35e1', 'eaf684be-87d5-49e4-82d0-a05a6ae48b4b', 'Bebras Challenge', 'Tantangan computational thinking melalui Website Bebras Challenge untuk mengasah logical thinking.', 3001, '3d49bd82-4287-42f5-800b-f150307fad18', '2026-01-17 01:30:00+00', 'Akses Website Bebras Challenge dan selesaikan minimal 8 soal. Dokumentasikan solusi dan reflection. Submit dokumentasi.', '2026-01-29 09:36:11.021508+00', '2026-03-26 14:05:06.630682+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQQNedG1aTHgCIld1H5BjZRgi_nMX_-zJt9Kd972lAhqnlb4xUwNbezNpcGDOFNDQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('58c121cc-fce0-4e26-a1ec-dab277561661', 'df2b2191-fb2e-4411-a510-69dc42278774', '9e2bffd4-fce1-4513-9cf2-3076f31fade4', 'Explore Canva Infografis Traveling Zoo', 'Pembelajaran information design dan visual communication menggunakan Canva dengan fokus pada infographic creation. Dengan tema Traveling Lets Go to the Zoo siswa akan memahami berbagai media untuk research memilah informasi dan menyajikannya dalam format infografis.', 7001, NULL, NULL, 'Pelajari infographic design 1) Research multi-source information tentang zoo of choice 2) Select most valuable information 3) Study effective infographics 4) Design zoo infographic di Canva dengan compelling title organized sections visuals color palette. Submit research source list final zoo infographic design rationale.', '2026-01-30 04:47:54.914227+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:30.041886+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTKX2m_VyOTrjdZJSueZBohbTxjJ4MdVOBh34AdZah7wrnmsvuUrZGFpvLVJSYMow/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
