	('cd112c15-deb8-407d-af23-8cfac8da220c', '84bc66e8-96fe-4fc9-a048-97909dfc9957', 'b0e866a9-3263-4ff8-bcc8-87bb9231d81c', 'Explore Code.Org Debugging dan Looping (Part 1)', 'Pembelajaran mendalam tentang debugging process dan advanced looping functions dalam pemrograman menggunakan Code.org. Siswa akan memahami systematic debugging approach dan optimization melalui proper use of loops.', 1001, NULL, NULL, 'Pelajari advanced debugging dan looping concepts di Code.org 1) Complete debugging-focused modules minimal 12 puzzles 2) Master complex looping patterns nested loops loops with conditionals 3) Create challenging puzzle solution demonstrating mastery 4) Document debugging mindset. Submit course completion certificates debugging case studies loop optimization examples.', '2026-01-29 09:37:24.882078+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:13.142536+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
