	('7b64c779-fecb-4065-9aa6-d825b9ba95d6', '40ebda8f-7543-4065-a279-a0107616454f', '6063d915-d703-48de-bbeb-40afba875915', 'Firebase Setup', 'Menghubungkan JS dengan database online Firebase. Setup Firebase project dan tes koneksi.', 9001, NULL, NULL, 'Setup Firebase Console. Koneksikan aplikasi web dengan Firebase. Submit Connected Page.', '2026-02-11 06:36:05.843811+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:57.272946+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('28cbae2c-3cb9-425f-9255-ec875a8900b7', 'f7f5afbc-59c3-4451-9c6e-c4cf8e815bb9', '1e2b5692-9a9c-4121-9fda-656cc750cc28', 'Project Game Challenge (Part 2)', 'Alun-alun kota', 6002, NULL, NULL, 'Selesaikan challenge ''Project Game Challenge'' dan submit hasilnya', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.642079+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:39.894977+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRODVxN5lOtrW2gDWzlwYuGzuz1-763hNMP3jkqpr_n5Cs5u3Y1ST3pwD3LJ80SVA/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('5ecc948a-e3a9-4ba1-a3ac-a16ee549fdb0', '79d71816-a89e-478f-a27a-a1bd2938df11', 'e76e6265-6a5b-4432-8286-d89ca3c2794b', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 3 Transportasi (Part 3)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar ketiga dengan tema Transportasi memberikan complete freedom untuk memilih customer segment identify specific transportation problem dan design innovative solution dalam bentuk produk digital bebas.', 9003, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan Big Project 3 1) Deep dive research survey minimal 10 respondents tentang transportation issues 2) Define specific problem statement dengan user personas 3) Brainstorm minimum 5 solution approaches 4) Build product menggunakan platform yang appropriate 5) User testing minimal 8 testers 6) Iterate dan finalize. Submit research report problem statement ideation process final product testing report.', '2026-01-29 09:37:24.534086+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:12.113407+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQx4wBDaRKu5MZ7WKGYthiu4IeVnjZs6-I9lou4iEXM1BH9lt1MlqtTkY1HEVRtcQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('c7828f74-a834-47b3-ad16-aa02bbe5ff93', '5e88081d-934a-43a2-9d26-661e218fa637', 'a1bcb78f-27e2-4670-88ab-c441f4876297', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 1 (Part 3)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar pertama dengan tema Treasure Hunt Nusantara. Siswa akan membuat game treasure hunt yang menampilkan kekayaan budaya Nusantara.', 11003, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan Big Project 1 Treasure Hunt Nusantara 1) Riset tentang budaya dan landmark Nusantara 2) Buat game design document 3) Develop game treasure hunt yang menampilkan minimal 5 lokasi ikonik Indonesia 4) Testing dan polish. Submit game link design document dan dokumentasi proses.', '2026-01-29 09:07:08.196347+00', '2026-03-26 12:13:56.868854+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vSTpvmEtnY2MyyAscF64IrjEYTyRa6S-NnprDBiDYui-U9Ucrxf5E0iigoNUmfEwQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('7a8d1da8-2d8c-4a29-90e8-5aa51d6594c6', '0878baf6-15cf-492e-bed7-093f20eac318', '73816d59-095a-4ff8-abde-edbe2c844547', 'Project 17 Kodu Game Lab Farming (Part 1)', 'Proyek game simulasi 3D dengan tema Farming natural resources. Siswa akan memahami dan mengimplementasikan proses pertanian dari tanam hingga panen dalam game simulation yang mengajarkan resource management.', 5001, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan farming simulation game di Kodu 1) Choose farming type crop farming animal husbandry fishing research realistic elements 2) Plan simulation mechanics planting care growth harvesting economics 3) Build Kodu game dengan farm environment resource tracking growth cycle economic system 4) Balance realism dan fun. Submit game link simulation design document gameplay video reflection.', '2026-01-29 09:12:25.866926+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:03.173922+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('280a5a3d-9f81-4dd7-af6c-21e5cb03f313', '6c859fca-cb28-457f-ba4c-ac2c8f66c66f', '3381333c-c6ef-43ae-80bc-97bd4165ab18', 'Explore Book Creator Buku Cerita', 'Pembelajaran pembuatan buku cerita digital dengan tema My First Comic Book Story Telling. Siswa akan belajar bercerita secara visual menggunakan Book Creator.', 1, 'a0ce1d6e-0651-470b-a9ce-724a3bdd4d21', '2025-06-13 09:15:00+00', 'Pelajari cara menggunakan Book Creator untuk membuat buku cerita digital. Buat latihan komik sederhana dengan karakter dialog dan ilustrasi menarik. Submit hasil buku cerita.', '2026-02-27 10:11:59.750921+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:01.775613+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRqUANe2X5OYcDdGS7Veynyvflwi7QvHibpqAyQ2spUP5R20d1mSIFxu8jgtbp3QQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('6995548f-3e95-42ab-9a8a-7453a7626c05', 'f7f5afbc-59c3-4451-9c6e-c4cf8e815bb9', '55485a0b-ab97-400d-95ae-98e3848f4376', 'Enterpreneurship (Big Project 4) (Part 1)', 'Tata Kota Idaman', 7001, NULL, NULL, 'Selesaikan ''Enterpreneurship (Big Project 4)'' secara mandiri dan submit hasilnya', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.642079+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:39.970856+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('0025ef15-22c1-4da1-b572-22a78bda4e5c', '4c605558-707b-44cd-a1f9-7312383aafe1', '380ea3cf-36c1-44c9-91d9-72d54690e103', 'Project Game Challenge Funny Quiz Quest (Part 1)', 'Proyek pembuatan quiz game dengan tema Funny Quiz Quest. Siswa akan membuat quiz game pengetahuan dengan tema pilihan.', 5, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan proyek Funny Quiz Quest. Buat quiz game dengan minimal 20 soal tema pilihan varied question types dan engaging UI. Submit hasil game dan question bank.', '2026-02-27 10:12:00.228544+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:04.409933+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTUGo4iZB5suuyT42cbg3362n3sxzp8W-uakwukgMVKPkwn8RB267QPkJrikUER8w/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('a1e60fa7-4506-4c85-a0d1-a26a5f3a9f86', '4c605558-707b-44cd-a1f9-7312383aafe1', '39ae2adc-94e4-4790-8f02-d4ed3d93021e', 'Final Project Game Making (Part 1)', 'Fase intensive game development untuk membuat game lengkap dan polished. Siswa akan build complete game showcasing all Creator Level skills.', 12, NULL, NULL, 'Execute comprehensive game development 1) Core development 2) Feature implementation 3) Content dan levels 4) Polish dan finalization. Submit playable game development diary playtesting report dan trailer.', '2026-02-27 10:12:00.228544+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:04.677441+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('c67d37aa-54c6-46f5-97f2-52d27b02758a', 'f7f5afbc-59c3-4451-9c6e-c4cf8e815bb9', '55485a0b-ab97-400d-95ae-98e3848f4376', 'Enterpreneurship (Big Project 4) (Part 2)', 'Tata Kota Idaman', 7002, NULL, NULL, 'Selesaikan ''Enterpreneurship (Big Project 4)'' secara mandiri dan submit hasilnya', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.642079+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:40.008946+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('f79cb56e-f525-4075-a85e-dcd3f2f5ca9a', 'f7f5afbc-59c3-4451-9c6e-c4cf8e815bb9', '55485a0b-ab97-400d-95ae-98e3848f4376', 'Enterpreneurship (Big Project 4) (Part 3)', 'Tata Kota Idaman', 7003, NULL, NULL, 'Selesaikan ''Enterpreneurship (Big Project 4)'' secara mandiri dan submit hasilnya', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.642079+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:40.046366+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('c90907ba-8626-4b39-b977-51f82d7c6b6d', '64802966-cf9b-4913-81aa-00e75cbd54ed', '5dabe319-77d1-4d2f-ab4a-5f890db0b054', 'Challenge Boss Battle (Part 3)', 'Proyek pembuatan game petualangan dengan Boss Battle menggunakan GDevelop.', 5003, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan Challenge Boss Battle. Buat game petualangan yang diakhiri dengan boss fight. Submit game.', '2026-02-11 06:36:06.064242+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:58.547707+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('4805c506-1e5c-4e82-89d7-73defd145abf', '296b63d4-3c28-43be-95ca-988b9e680e21', 'f0f65a61-66f2-4909-b2cf-77e3bd35dce6', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 4 (Part 2)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar keempat dengan tema Tata Kota Idaman. Siswa akan membuat game open world dengan prinsip tata kota yang baik menggunakan Scratch 3.', 14, 'dd424b8f-f43c-40ca-b257-2cd06bedb445', '2026-02-13 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 4 Tata Kota Idaman 1) Riset prinsip urban planning yang baik 2) Buat game open world ideal city 3) Buat poster atau presentasi dengan Canva 4) Testing dan validasi. Submit game poster dan documentation.', '2026-02-27 10:11:59.917392+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:03.186089+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTXgdiGASqA3wK2BXo3cRWkL-Z9GSA42j7mg-2hzOX76AGoayEEePewZTe_oNSx3g/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('a0b51f2d-23f6-495c-8a7a-cfd9ada5612a', '98ebc317-eb94-4868-a9ad-5f44b99fa5fc', 'e8f3dd02-20e0-4dd7-9b29-88e51b2f2ddb', 'Explore Scratch 3 Scrolling Background (Part 1)', 'Pembelajaran teknik Scrolling Background di Scratch 3 dengan tema Traveling jalan-jalan ke daerah. Siswa akan memahami cara membuat background yang bergerak.', 9001, '9e7fff8c-c1dd-41da-a919-071829e1c94f', '2025-02-15 01:30:00+00', 'Pelajari teknik Scrolling Background di Scratch 3. Buat game traveling dengan background bergerak menampilkan pemandangan daerah wisata pilihan coach karakter bergerak dan obstacles. Submit hasil game.', '2026-01-30 04:48:53.319417+00', '2026-03-26 14:05:04.463126+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('7bb1b50e-009f-451b-a4ad-749daf070131', '98ebc317-eb94-4868-a9ad-5f44b99fa5fc', '28bce5c6-95b4-4841-a26b-790a6bd9c21a', 'Evaluasi dan Refleksi', 'Evaluasi dan refleksi comprehensive terhadap pembelajaran di Blok 1 melalui self-evaluation. Siswa akan analyze growth dalam app development Kodular game development Roblox dan entrepreneurial thinking.', 15001, 'fc40ff0e-cc40-46e4-a2ac-558cbb947596', '2025-07-19 01:30:00+00', 'Create comprehensive Blok 1 self-evaluation 1) Technical skills assessment Kodular Roblox platform comparison 2) Project portfolio review identify best work 3) Entrepreneurial development Big Project 1 reflection 4) Bebras CT progress 5) Collaboration soft skills 6) Goals setting. Submit thorough evaluation portfolio highlights honest assessment goals untuk Blok 2.', '2026-01-30 04:48:53.319417+00', '2026-03-26 14:05:05.440262+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vSvTb3_h0oEM6kl25P-6WFC9PZwJ9JGVPFmwczzFWioULZQmje8djByCjlQKYd2MQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('abdbf96e-d9da-4677-8521-680285bc0b5f', '79d71816-a89e-478f-a27a-a1bd2938df11', '6730b0a3-19af-4eff-943e-b3549e379f60', 'Project 13 Infografis Canva Traveling Pick Destination (Part 1)', 'Proyek kelompok untuk membuat infografis tentang destinasi wisata pilihan. Siswa bekerja sama dalam mencari informasi menarik dari berbagai media tentang sebuah destinasi wisata dan menyajikannya dalam infografis.', 8001, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan collaborative travel infographic project 2-3 orang 1) Team choose destination 2) Divide research responsibilities attractions food culture practical info 3) Compile information 4) Design infographic together in Canva 5) Review dan refine. Submit destination research report final travel infographic team process documentation.', '2026-01-29 09:37:24.534086+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:11.954276+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTWo4z4dbsuZ3MgoE1uj2ec-MdKpLL9_Vihac50eQJG2oOX8Uy8Wx4yzEvkEXKPEg/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('6a561b62-8013-4142-b4b2-09eb801189c6', '9682e61f-a7f0-48a5-95c8-616c8c5b508d', 'bb7a7522-3eaf-4866-8185-ed0b31fbaca6', 'Project 9 Game Challenge (Part 1)', 'Proyek pembuatan game musik dengan tema Traditional Instruments. Siswa akan membuat game yang menampilkan alat musik tradisional Indonesia.', 9001, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan proyek game Traditional Instruments menggunakan fitur Pen dan Loudness. Buat game yang menampilkan minimal 5 alat musik tradisional dengan interaksi suara dan visual. Submit hasil game.', '2026-01-29 09:07:08.380383+00', '2026-03-26 12:13:57.56307+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTBV5oacfr0pDjHumGu-SUVrMt3GfL6PIt0iixydnfABMTGVLW2_XGGOOQw52Vv4Q/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('b7b042c0-cc37-463e-95c9-b800f42ae584', '7c3602e7-3afc-4ba5-8ddb-c50e95102be9', 'b8103209-8aef-4ba6-a096-6a4d2389c78c', 'Latihan Presentasi', '', 12001, 'bb0759d8-29b5-4e5d-90a1-e5943dfce8c2', '2025-12-06 01:30:00+00', NULL, '2026-01-29 09:36:10.809857+00', '2026-03-26 14:05:06.360513+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('0208d3a3-9188-4364-90cb-4029482bab55', '37672074-9ed9-4ec5-a967-b25f10d04e5b', '9aaed038-db5b-4d17-befe-d5f4b143d88e', 'Project 5 Game Challenge (Part 1)', 'Proyek pembuatan game dengan tema Traveling Wisata Kuliner. Siswa akan membuat game traveling yang menampilkan wisata kuliner Indonesia.', 10001, '45c62451-4f17-482f-8bab-bef10d66eda0', '2025-12-26 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan proyek game Wisata Kuliner dengan teknik scrolling background. Buat game traveling yang menampilkan berbagai kuliner daerah Indonesia dengan collectibles scoring dan progression. Submit hasil game.', '2026-02-11 05:06:10.876085+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:37.525765+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vR8sVFKmYbNvPyiu5gRYUqb9ytkec7uV2z5T5X-QwQbIEIRlK0UzwwjYDSb-J7tgg/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
