	('0e1f8f6a-723f-45ff-bca1-632fad6d5c8f', '3ab75dd5-c5a0-4940-bc32-048e2f9fb7a3', '55485a0b-ab97-400d-95ae-98e3848f4376', 'Enterpreneurship (Big Project 4) (Part 4)', 'Tata Kota Idaman', 7004, NULL, NULL, 'Selesaikan ''Enterpreneurship (Big Project 4)'' secara mandiri dan submit hasilnya', '2026-01-29 09:36:11.250206+00', '2026-03-26 14:05:08.03474+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('86246941-897d-4019-86d7-562705ebef69', 'a818b032-c344-46dc-8405-dc610b5dfea8', '0cfa492c-2877-471d-ab37-fdd90b4f24d7', 'Final Project Poster (Part 1)', 'Pembuatan poster promosi untuk Final Project. Siswa akan membuat marketing materials yang professional.', 10001, NULL, NULL, 'Buat promotional poster dengan Canva. Design poster dengan hero image headline features dan call-to-action. Submit poster dan marketing strategy document.', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.822532+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:40.931464+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('493d0f4b-7a67-4d9e-bd16-9751b5607d34', '12091da3-6f91-4518-93ff-5a79c1725a90', '1e257dbe-9730-472b-afed-89ee1a4828a9', 'Project 4 Game Challenge (Part 2)', 'Proyek pembuatan game dengan tema Makanan Tradisional. Siswa akan membuat game yang menampilkan makanan tradisional Indonesia.', 12, '8467a34a-b6ce-4102-9b88-17e425c1cc60', '2024-12-13 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan proyek game dengan tema Makanan Tradisional Indonesia. Buat game yang menampilkan minimal 5 jenis makanan tradisional dengan mekanik interaktif scoring dan timer. Submit hasil game.', '2026-02-27 10:12:46.559211+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:00.748245+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vS8ty56z-PMdSgTxNr1bFkrRCrsua9rlQgAZHKf1Nd2fNAX3S33nmnCGlP9nKZHTQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('011d823d-d475-4843-b1b4-bf43de87d2b0', '84bc66e8-96fe-4fc9-a048-97909dfc9957', '89ade428-8bc2-4108-a7c1-0eb53f0611e1', 'Evaluasi dan Refleksi', 'Evaluasi dan refleksi ultima untuk entire Explorer Level journey comprehensive self-evaluation covering all 5 bloks portfolio curation celebrating growth dan envisioning future path.', 14001, NULL, NULL, 'Create ultimate comprehensive self-evaluation 1) Journey mapping visual timeline all 5 bloks 2) Portfolio curation select best works 10-12 showcase pieces 3) Skills inventory growth analysis 4) Big Projects retrospective 5) Explorer Level legacy 6) Future vision 7) Gratitude acknowledgments. Submit comprehensive portfolio skills inventory retrospective analysis legacy statement future vision plan final evaluation presentation.', '2026-01-29 09:37:24.882078+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:13.942663+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('34ca2055-bac5-47ce-b61c-004e98b77ab9', '12091da3-6f91-4518-93ff-5a79c1725a90', 'e8f3dd02-20e0-4dd7-9b29-88e51b2f2ddb', 'Explore Scratch 3 Scrolling Background (Part 1)', 'Pembelajaran teknik Scrolling Background di Scratch 3 dengan tema Traveling jalan-jalan ke daerah. Siswa akan memahami cara membuat background yang bergerak.', 13, 'd5006a73-916a-4916-aa02-a4bd7f5e7eb5', '2024-12-27 09:15:00+00', 'Pelajari teknik Scrolling Background di Scratch 3. Buat game traveling dengan background bergerak menampilkan pemandangan daerah wisata pilihan coach karakter bergerak dan obstacles. Submit hasil game.', '2026-02-27 10:12:46.559211+00', '2026-03-26 12:15:00.823486+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('fc140372-fb80-4d50-b944-ef37bfb1e298', '9f0b399f-bc3d-47d1-8d32-4ebb76d6e75d', '1ed26e4f-9229-4fca-9ae0-4c5ec907f3e3', 'Bebras Challenge', 'Tantangan computational thinking melalui Website Bebras Challenge untuk mengasah kemampuan problem-solving.', 5001, 'b7378666-f24d-4aff-b68c-5a6df750e7ac', '2026-04-24 09:15:00+00', 'Akses Website Bebras Challenge dan selesaikan minimal 8 soal computational thinking. Dokumentasikan solusi dan penjelasan kemudian submit hasilnya.', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.122175+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:38.175071+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRPg_AiPA43eURzpjlLdKeNQqcol-4YYyEId_M4bCFywJOHfWN9oAOxbHn0iizPJg/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('b17f60cf-0c24-4ebd-9748-caa38d9cef9e', '629c3aa4-cbd6-4f09-810f-8f32da641aa8', 'f0f65a61-66f2-4909-b2cf-77e3bd35dce6', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 4 (Part 3)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar keempat dengan tema Tata Kota Idaman. Siswa akan membuat game open world dengan prinsip tata kota yang baik menggunakan Scratch 3.', 7003, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan Big Project 4 Tata Kota Idaman 1) Riset prinsip urban planning yang baik 2) Buat game open world ideal city 3) Buat poster atau presentasi dengan Canva 4) Testing dan validasi. Submit game poster dan documentation.', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.389823+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:39.300999+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vTXgdiGASqA3wK2BXo3cRWkL-Z9GSA42j7mg-2hzOX76AGoayEEePewZTe_oNSx3g/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('fda8845d-6db4-43dd-afd0-abd88160c902', 'bee8ea18-d7d4-4191-9aae-5723a2e8540f', 'e76e6265-6a5b-4432-8286-d89ca3c2794b', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 3 Transportasi (Part 2)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar ketiga dengan tema Transportasi memberikan complete freedom untuk memilih customer segment identify specific transportation problem dan design innovative solution dalam bentuk produk digital bebas.', 9002, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan Big Project 3 1) Deep dive research survey minimal 10 respondents tentang transportation issues 2) Define specific problem statement dengan user personas 3) Brainstorm minimum 5 solution approaches 4) Build product menggunakan platform yang appropriate 5) User testing minimal 8 testers 6) Iterate dan finalize. Submit research report problem statement ideation process final product testing report.', '2026-01-29 09:12:25.686155+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:02.603446+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQx4wBDaRKu5MZ7WKGYthiu4IeVnjZs6-I9lou4iEXM1BH9lt1MlqtTkY1HEVRtcQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('91ec6038-b128-403f-814f-d2fefdfbdee3', 'df2b2191-fb2e-4411-a510-69dc42278774', 'e76e6265-6a5b-4432-8286-d89ca3c2794b', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 3 Transportasi (Part 3)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar ketiga dengan tema Transportasi memberikan complete freedom untuk memilih customer segment identify specific transportation problem dan design innovative solution dalam bentuk produk digital bebas.', 9003, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan Big Project 3 1) Deep dive research survey minimal 10 respondents tentang transportation issues 2) Define specific problem statement dengan user personas 3) Brainstorm minimum 5 solution approaches 4) Build product menggunakan platform yang appropriate 5) User testing minimal 8 testers 6) Iterate dan finalize. Submit research report problem statement ideation process final product testing report.', '2026-01-30 04:47:54.914227+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:30.229516+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQx4wBDaRKu5MZ7WKGYthiu4IeVnjZs6-I9lou4iEXM1BH9lt1MlqtTkY1HEVRtcQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('4bae1cde-c9f2-4456-be81-0572e5d02846', 'a818b032-c344-46dc-8405-dc610b5dfea8', '49e73926-f8ce-46ef-a607-560a2a176c29', 'Latihan Presentasi', '', 11001, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 05:06:11.822532+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:41.005034+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('82eac572-3c0c-473d-97ec-4f8c47d81674', '3bff7b04-2b5e-4949-b761-dae02e358bba', 'a1bcb78f-27e2-4670-88ab-c441f4876297', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 1 (Part 2)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar pertama dengan tema Treasure Hunt Nusantara. Siswa akan membuat game treasure hunt yang menampilkan kekayaan budaya Nusantara.', 11002, '10590097-7791-4b39-9108-93b5c02cbda1', '2024-08-10 03:30:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 1 Treasure Hunt Nusantara 1) Riset tentang budaya dan landmark Nusantara 2) Buat game design document 3) Develop game treasure hunt yang menampilkan minimal 5 lokasi ikonik Indonesia 4) Testing dan polish. Submit game link design document dan dokumentasi proses.', '2026-01-29 09:42:10.848373+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:15.463548+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vSTpvmEtnY2MyyAscF64IrjEYTyRa6S-NnprDBiDYui-U9Ucrxf5E0iigoNUmfEwQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
