	('3feff87f-aae7-48b1-86ea-e2027886fca5', '53f1d715-a576-43ee-a60e-d60cd3ed36a6', '7fdf8d80-94a2-4587-8196-a46ba67ebd68', 'Explore Scratch Jr. : Game Transportasi', 'Pembelajaran game 2D dengan tema Transportasi dan Aturan Lalu Lintas. Siswa akan berkreasi dalam mendesain tampilan game, memahami fungsi setiap blok program, dan dapat melakukan debugging pada kesalahan program yang ditemukan.', 3001, '750c84a3-27a2-41ae-bf51-22846ca5b872', '2025-07-23 12:30:00+00', 'Pelajari cara membuat game sederhana di Scratch Jr dengan tema transportasi. Buatlah latihan game yang menampilkan kendaraan dan aturan lalu lintas dasar.', '2026-01-29 09:12:25.305298+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:00.599058+00', 'https://www.canva.com/design/DAGu6eZxtOU/22biCwBocq1xtWX7WufQpA/view?embed', NULL, NULL),
	('fc864ca5-7c97-48ed-b185-549ce31bfd48', 'ba1d7f61-804a-4234-8326-e5d8c369985a', 'a1bcb78f-27e2-4670-88ab-c441f4876297', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 1 (Part 4)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar pertama dengan tema Treasure Hunt Nusantara. Siswa akan membuat game treasure hunt yang menampilkan kekayaan budaya Nusantara.', 11004, '4f0d4447-0899-4bef-9d03-23db5f3e0c6b', '2024-09-07 03:30:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 1 Treasure Hunt Nusantara 1) Riset tentang budaya dan landmark Nusantara 2) Buat game design document 3) Develop game treasure hunt yang menampilkan minimal 5 lokasi ikonik Indonesia 4) Testing dan polish. Submit game link design document dan dokumentasi proses.', '2026-01-30 04:49:44.639514+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:15.609001+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vSTpvmEtnY2MyyAscF64IrjEYTyRa6S-NnprDBiDYui-U9Ucrxf5E0iigoNUmfEwQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('f3007c81-c5d3-4150-b810-89db46a8842a', '37672074-9ed9-4ec5-a967-b25f10d04e5b', '9056504c-0670-4601-9e59-739542e56cda', 'Project 3 Game Challenge', 'Proyek pembuatan game dengan tema Kehidupan di Taman. Siswa akan implementasi konsep game sederhana dalam setting taman.', 5001, '0a2a08bd-b201-4550-85c1-aa73c6b8ade8', '2025-10-31 09:15:00+00', 'Kerjakan proyek game dengan tema Kehidupan di Taman. Buat game interaktif yang menampilkan aktivitas di taman dengan minimal 2 jenis interaksi dan sistem scoring. Submit hasil game.', '2026-02-11 05:06:10.876085+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:37.209622+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vRE-SDy3IUptbuY3ZSr5HMwRSjXVXRzo3ncu-R8hESZSU_mcSz9P2kzNLr7yYCF1w/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('947f8cec-4bad-4fdc-a5c0-3e949caacf18', '9f0b399f-bc3d-47d1-8d32-4ebb76d6e75d', '11d54515-cc11-47c6-bc0d-49444e7ba8ec', 'Evaluasi dan Refleksi', 'Evaluasi dan refleksi comprehensive terhadap pembelajaran di Blok 1 melalui self-evaluation. Siswa akan analyze growth dalam app development Kodular game development Roblox dan entrepreneurial thinking.', 14001, NULL, NULL, 'Create comprehensive Blok 1 self-evaluation 1) Technical skills assessment Kodular Roblox platform comparison 2) Project portfolio review identify best work 3) Entrepreneurial development Big Project 1 reflection 4) Bebras CT progress 5) Collaboration soft skills 6) Goals setting. Submit thorough evaluation portfolio highlights honest assessment goals untuk Blok 2.', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.122175+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:38.747237+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vQPZ-PrQxYED5FpFw12ZzIYRA5HlCIktRjf62QsQpe_0KwvDcOU-1it3fo1sOql3g/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('4e6a8a48-3463-40c3-8602-794fe9765351', 'ba1d7f61-804a-4234-8326-e5d8c369985a', '28bce5c6-95b4-4841-a26b-790a6bd9c21a', 'Evaluasi dan Refleksi', 'Evaluasi dan refleksi comprehensive terhadap pembelajaran di Blok 1 melalui self-evaluation. Siswa akan analyze growth dalam app development Kodular game development Roblox dan entrepreneurial thinking.', 15001, '5e35d6bc-abd0-4e0f-8110-00b368f99d0e', '2024-10-26 03:30:00+00', 'Create comprehensive Blok 1 self-evaluation 1) Technical skills assessment Kodular Roblox platform comparison 2) Project portfolio review identify best work 3) Entrepreneurial development Big Project 1 reflection 4) Bebras CT progress 5) Collaboration soft skills 6) Goals setting. Submit thorough evaluation portfolio highlights honest assessment goals untuk Blok 2.', '2026-01-30 04:49:44.639514+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:15.878588+00', 'https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/e/2PACX-1vSvTb3_h0oEM6kl25P-6WFC9PZwJ9JGVPFmwczzFWioULZQmje8djByCjlQKYd2MQ/embed?start=false&loop=false&delayms=60000', NULL, NULL),
	('a5fca97d-fc4a-461b-b602-e66c12560d72', '84bc66e8-96fe-4fc9-a048-97909dfc9957', '4d811d24-42c8-4d26-8cf6-5c3427285fab', 'Study Tour Game Company Virtual Visit dan Reverse Engineering (Part 2)', 'Pembelajaran tentang real-world professional game development process melalui virtual visit ke game companies dan praktik reverse engineering analyzing popular games untuk memahami development considerations.', 5002, NULL, NULL, 'Complete virtual study tour dan reverse engineering 1) Watch minimal 3 game studio content types large studio indie developer documentary 2) Play selected game extensively 3) Deconstruct core loop progression UI art audio implementation 4) Industry insights synthesis. Submit observation report reverse engineering analysis career exploration reflection.', '2026-01-29 09:37:24.882078+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:13.442685+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('5ab06bc3-8364-4fe4-abb4-4f9eac9eb16b', 'fe2cfe72-4ec5-4d99-8484-bc836ea9f7ab', '4d674db0-ba46-43e1-ab0e-7e160eae5460', 'Enterpreneurship Big Project 2 (Part 4)', 'Proyek kewirausahaan besar kedua dengan tema Volcanoes Threats and Benefits. Siswa akan membuat produk edukasi tentang gunung berapi.', 10004, '975f2734-1c0f-4c2e-bdd4-a749966482b8', '2025-03-08 03:30:00+00', 'Kerjakan Big Project 2 Volcanoes 1) Riset tentang gunung berapi di Indonesia ancaman dan manfaatnya 2) Buat game atau aplikasi edukasi 3) Testing dengan user 4) Buat poster promosi. Submit produk final research report testing documentation.', '2026-01-29 09:42:11.089167+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:16.590656+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
