	('e002640b-de45-4fa6-9e11-bf88c05a284e', '84bc66e8-96fe-4fc9-a048-97909dfc9957', '5b555dc6-c2fd-41d5-a7bc-dfb30f75034f', 'Final Project Game Making (Part 3)', 'Fase intensive game development core production phase dimana siswa implement game product dengan full features polish dan quality. 4 meetings dedicated untuk create best possible game showcasing all Explorer Level learning.', 8003, NULL, NULL, 'Execute comprehensive game development 1) Concept finalization select concept create Game Design Document 2) Core development build foundational structure first level 3) Content features expand all levels implement all features polish UI 4) Polish optimization bug hunt add feedback elements create trailer. Submit Meeting 1-2 GDD playable prototype. Meeting 3-4 complete game playtesting log trailer post-mortem document.', '2026-01-29 09:37:24.882078+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:13.634146+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('066dd948-fca1-4eac-8bd7-8a72aae4352a', '629c3aa4-cbd6-4f09-810f-8f32da641aa8', '8db54b19-80b1-446f-8d09-429ec0b4d6a9', 'Project App Challenge (Part 2)', 'Proyek pembuatan aplikasi lanjutan dengan AppLab. Siswa akan membuat aplikasi yang lebih sophisticated.', 2002, NULL, NULL, 'Kerjakan proyek aplikasi dengan AppLab. Buat aplikasi lengkap dengan tema bebas fitur advanced dan user testing. Submit hasil aplikasi dan testing report.', '2026-02-11 05:06:11.389823+00', '2026-03-26 12:14:38.855883+00', NULL, NULL, NULL),
