	(452, '6282121271066', '{"type": "ai", "content": "Baik Ayah/Bunda, berikut jadwal lengkap Holiday Class Level Explorer (Kelas 1-3) untuk 3 minggu ke depan:\n\n*WEEK 1 (22-27 Desember 2025):*\n• ONLINE  \n  - Program: Rainy Day Rescue (Kodu) + The Lost Raindrop (Scratch) + Jumping Puddles (Scratch Jr.)  \n  - Jadwal: 22-24 Des 2025, pukul 10.00-11.30 WIB  \n  - Pitching Day: 26 Des 2025\n\n• OFFLINE - Rumah Tebing (Cibubur)  \n  - Program sama seperti online  \n  - Jadwal: 22-24 Des 2025, pukul 10.00-11.30 WIB  \n  - Pitching Day: 26 Des 2025\n\n• OFFLINE - Yapenka (Jakarta Selatan)  \n  - Program sama  \n  - Jadwal: 22 Des 2025, pukul 09.00-14.30 WIB (1 hari full tanpa pitching terpisah)\n\n*WEEK 2 (29 Des 2025 - 3 Jan 2026):*\n• ONLINE & OFFLINE Rumah Tebing  \n  - Program: Snow Explorer (Kodu) + Rainy Cafe (Scratch) + Little Chicken Saver (Scratch Jr.)  \n  - Jadwal: 29-31 Des 2025 & 2 Jan 2026, pukul 13.00-14.30 WIB  \n  - Pitching Day: 2 Jan 2026\n\n• OFFLINE - Yapenka  \n  - Program sama  \n  - Jadwal: 30 Des 2025, pukul 09.00-14.30 WIB (1 hari full tanpa pitching terpisah)\n\n*WEEK 3 (6-11 Jan 2026):*\n• ONLINE & OFFLINE Rumah Tebing  \n  - Program: Astro Rover Rescue (Kodu) + Save the Baby Turtle (Scratch) + The Lost Duckling (Scratch Jr.)  \n  - Jadwal: 6-9 Jan 2026, pukul 10.00-11.30 WIB  \n  - Pitching Day: 9 Jan 2026\n\n• OFFLINE - Yapenka  \n  - Program sama  \n  - Jadwal: 7 Jan 2026, pukul 09.00-14.30 WIB (1 hari full tanpa pitching terpisah)\n\nAyah/Bunda prefer ikut yang opsi *Online* atau *Offline*? Jika offline, lokasi Rumah Tebing Cibubur atau Yapenka Jakarta Selatan? 😊", "tool_calls": [], "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "invalid_tool_calls": []}'),
