	(4098, '6287856251122', '{"type": "ai", "content": "Baik Ayah/Bunda, noted *weekday*. Boleh tau putra/putrinya kelas berapa (contoh: *3 SD* / *1 SMP*)? 😊\n\nAyah/Bunda ingin *trial* atau sekadar informasi program dulu, dan prefer *online* atau *offline* untuk kegiatan ini? Setelah konfirmasi saya akan cek jadwal weekday yang tersedia.", "tool_calls": [], "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "invalid_tool_calls": []}'),
	(4099, '6287856251122', '{"type": "human", "content": "Kelas 5", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}}'),
	(4100, '6287856251122', '{"type": "ai", "content": "Untuk kelas 5 (kategori 4-6) ada 7 materi seru: *Canva - Social Media Content (Fact vs Hoax Campaign)*, *Canva - Video Explainer (The Science of Fasting)*, *Canva - Personal Blog/Profile (Local Hero Profile)*, *Canva - Interactive Quiz Game (Cultural Diversity Quiz)*, *Canva - Environmental Campaign (Go Green Movement)*, *Canva - Music/Podcast Cover (Creative Audio Project)*, dan *Canva - Tutorial Video (Life Skills Academy).* Semua kelas praktik langsung pakai *Canva*, 1 hari 1 project supaya anak pulang bawa portfolio.\n\nAnak Ayah/Bunda tertarik ke materi yang mana, atau ingin saya carikan jadwal trial gratis? (Prefer *weekday* atau *weekend*, dan *online* atau *offline*?) Slot terbatas, saya bantu cek segera ya 😊", "tool_calls": [], "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "invalid_tool_calls": []}'),
